wWidth10449\cellx10449\pard\plain\intbl\nowwrap\s0\ql\fi0\li0\ri0\sl120\plain\f3\fs18\cf0 This course centers on theoretical understanding of foundational concepts and key algorithms in machine learning, supplemented by hands-on practice using ML tools and real-world case studies.  \par\pard\plain\intbl\nowwrap\s0\ql\fi0\li0\ri0\sl120\plain\f3\fs18\cf0 Students aim to grasp the overall structure of machine learning and develop the ability to select and apply appropriate models.  \par\pard\plain\intbl\nowwrap\s0\ql\fi0\li0\ri0\sl120\plain\f3\fs18\cf0 \f3\fs18\cf0 \par\pard\plain\intbl\nowwrap\s0\ql\fi0\li0\ri0\sl120\plain\f3\fs18\cf0 Course Learning Outcomes\par\pard\plain\intbl\nowwrap\s0\ql\fi0\li0\ri0\sl120\plain\f3\fs18\cf0 Students who successfully complete this course will achieve the following learning outcomes:\par\pard\plain\intbl\nowwrap\s0\ql\fi0\li0\ri0\sl120\plain\f3\fs18\cf0 \f3\fs18\cf0 \par\pard\plain\intbl\nowwrap\s0\ql\fi0\li0\ri0\sl120\plain\f3\fs18\cf0 - Distinguish and explain the definition of machine learning and various learning types (supervised learning, unsupervised learning, etc.).\par\pard\plain\intbl\nowwrap\s0\ql\fi0\li0\ri0\sl120\plain\f3\fs18\cf0 - Understand the operating principles and characteristics of major algorithms such as regression, classification, and clustering.\par\pard\plain\intbl\nowwrap\s0\ql\fi0\li0\ri0\sl120\plain\f3\fs18\cf0 - Select suitable machine learning algorithms for real-world cases and propose application strategies.\par\pard\plain\intbl\nowwrap\s0\ql\fi0\li0\ri0\sl120\plain\f3\fs18\cf0 - Interpret basic performance metrics for models (accuracy, precision, recall, etc.).\par\pard\plain\intbl\nowwrap\s0\ql\fi0\li0\ri0\sl120\plain\f3\fs18\cf0 - Develop skills to apply theory, summarize, and present through simple team projects.\par\pard\plain\intbl\nowwrap\s0\ql\fi0\li0\ri0\sl120\plain\f3\fs18\cf0 \f3\fs18\cf0 \par\pard\plain\intbl\nowwrap\s0\ql\fi0\li0\ri0\sl120\plain\f3\fs18\cf0 Class Format and Delivery Method\par\pard\plain\intbl\nowwrap\s0\ql\fi0\li0\ri0\sl120\plain\f3\fs18\cf0 \f3\fs18\cf0 \par\pard\plain\intbl\nowwrap\s0\ql\fi0\li0\ri0\sl120\plain\f3\fs18\cf0 Classes are primarily conducted in lecture format, with theoretical explanations demonstrated using machine learning tools (e.g., scikit-learn, PyTorch).  \par\pard\plain\intbl\nowwrap\s0\ql\fi0\li0\ri0\sl120\plain\f3\fs18\cf0 Students gain practical experience by implementing and experimenting with models through homework and projects.  \par\pard\plain\intbl\nowwrap\s0\ql\fi0\li0\ri0\sl120\plain\f3\fs18\cf0 Project results are summarized in presentations, accompanied by group discussions to enhance knowledge sharing and critical thinking.\cell \trowd\trftsWidth3\trwWidth10449\tposx728\tposy3780\trrh-5906\trql\trgaph10\trbrdrh\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf0\trbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf0\trbrdrv\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf0\trbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf0\trbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf0\trbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf0\trpaddl-10\trpaddr-10\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3\clvertalt\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf0\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf0\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf0\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf0\clcbpat1\clftsWidth3\clwWidth10449\cellx10449\row\pard\trowd\trftsWidth3\trwWidth10464\tposx737\tposy10594\trrh-714\trql\trgaph10\trbrdrh\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf0\trbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf0\trbrdrv\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf0\trbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf0\trbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf0\trbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf0\trpaddl-10\trpaddr-10\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3\clvertalc\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf0\clcbpat1\clftsWidth3\clwWidth10464\cellx10464\pard\plain\intbl\nowwrap\s0\ql\fi0\li0\ri0\sl160\plain\f2\fs22\b\cf0 4.1\u-15848?\u-14907?\u-11319?\u-21504? \u-17608?\u-10899?\u-16096?\u-12067?\b0\cell \trowd\trftsWidth3\trwWidth10464\tposx737\tposy10594\trrh-714\trql\trgaph10\trbrdrh\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf0\trbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf0\trbrdrv\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf0\trbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf0\trbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf0\trbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf0\trpaddl-10\t